-      "edescr": "Zero metres disables the add-on. Set the distance to begin checking conditions. A value of 250m retains the former range, and 300–400m can also be selected. The former ON setting migrates to 250m at startup. Adds to existing ATC modes 1 and 2. At 10km/h or above and within the configured distance of a TBT right turn or right fork, requests the right indicator until the turn starts. Requires the Ioniq 5 PE USB2CAN setup, AutoBlinkerControl=2 and LaneChangeNeedTorque=0. Rear admission uses fresh OEM BSD warnings only, without corner distances. Every detected right-lane front target must be at least 5m away now and after a three-second constant-relative-speed projection. Radar errors or stale input block initiation. Steering before a request resets confirmation; driver intervention after a request cancels it. Signals started below 30km/h remain indication-only until they end; only starts at or above 30km/h enter ordinary lane-change handling. Requires at least 2.5m beyond the right boundary to the road edge.",
+      "edescr": "Zero metres disables the add-on. Set the distance to begin checking conditions. A value of 250m retains the former range, and 300–400m can also be selected. The former ON setting migrates to 250m at startup. Adds to existing ATC modes 1 and 2. At 10km/h or above and within the configured distance of a TBT right turn or right fork, requests the right indicator until the turn starts. Requires the protocol-matched USB2CAN, BLE or Panda/SPAS setup, AutoBlinkerControl=2 and LaneChangeNeedTorque=0. Rear admission uses fresh OEM BSD warnings only, without corner distances. Every detected right-lane front target must be at least 5m away now and after a three-second constant-relative-speed projection. Radar errors or stale input block initiation. Steering before a request resets confirmation; driver intervention after a request cancels it. Signals started below 30km/h remain indication-only until they end; only starts at or above 30km/h enter ordinary lane-change handling. Requires at least 2.5m beyond the right boundary to the road edge.",
       "cgroup": "转向设置",
